      "CutsceneStrId": "JOURNEY_ARCANA_NKM_UNIT_S_MAID_BELL_02",
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "소리가 난 곳으로 고개를 돌려보니…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "声が聞こえた方を見てみると…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
